126 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 364 0 R
/E (This project aimed to design and implement a hardware-accelerated Convolutional Neural Network \(CNN\) inference system on a Xilinx Zynq System-on-Chip \(SoC\). The objective was to offload computationally intensive CNN operations to the FPGA fabric \(Programmable Logic - PL\) while managing preprocessing and control through the Processing System \(PS\).)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
127 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 365 0 R
/E (We design leveraged AXI interfaces and AXI DMA for high-speed data transfer between PS and PL. The CNN accelerator was developed using Vitis HLS and integrated into Vivado Block Design. Although full hardware validation could not be completed due to AXI-DMA and synchronization challenges, substantial progress was made in hardware design, integration, simulation, and debugging.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
