129 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 366 0 R
/E (Deep learning models, particularly CNNs, demand high computational throughput. Running CNN inference purely on a processor results in high latency and power consumption.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1 2]
>>
endobj
